[ti:Holophrasis]
[ar:言和]
[al:ELOHIM]
[by:RQvan]
[00:00.00]Holophrasis
[00:02.00]
[00:04.00]曲：星辉p
[00:05.00]词：大九_LN
[00:06.00]调：瑞安Ryan不跑调
[00:07.00]绘：多尔及利亚
[00:08.00]
[00:21.10]Where else can I go?
[00:24.43]Elusive, like a ghost of thought
[00:29.50]Sorry to be a stain
[00:30.99]Of the unscathed world
[00:33.57]My last word for you isn’t here

[00:39.30]The moon pulls gleaming waves
[00:42.80]Erasing ways I can escape
[00:47.23]What should I write for epitaph
[00:52.46]You can’t say no again
[00:55.86]Puns in lines
[00:57.60]Stories you once hate
[01:01.33]I’ll remember them

[01:04.46]Everyone shall stand on their feet
[01:13.03]Even the death will take their breath away
[01:30.48]
[01:45.50]Orbs of will rolling towards the edge of my tombstone
[01:53.74]
[02:03.70]Which of rules can I break
[02:07.14]Shrilling noise across the night of symphony

[02:11.90]Life only finds its worth with the end
[02:16.80]Crowned by honour’s wreath
[02:20.27]The sun descends, then rises higher than
[02:25.80]As it can

[02:28.98]Everyone shall find their bouquet
[02:37.60]Even the death will take their breath
[02:50.20]Their stories remain here, alive
[03:04.30]
[00:21.10]我还能去何处
[00:24.43]如幻如魅，思绪的幽灵
[00:29.50]抱歉在这未受损的世界中
[00:30.99]成为一团污点
[00:33.57]留给你的遗言不在此处

[00:39.30]月亮牵引粼粼波光
[00:42.80]抹除我逃生的路
[00:47.23]我应写下什么作墓志铭
[00:52.46]让你无法再次拒绝
[00:55.86]句行中的双关
[00:57.60]你曾厌恶的故事
[01:01.33]我都会记得它们

[01:04.46]每个人应以自己的双足而立
[01:13.03]即使死亡会夺走他们的气息
[01:30.48]
[01:45.50]自我意志凝结成光球滚向墓碑边缘
[01:53.74]
[02:03.70]我能打破哪条规则
[02:07.14]伴以尖啸声穿越交响之夜

[02:11.90]生命在终结时才得知它的价值
[02:16.80]加冕荣誉的花环
[02:20.27]太阳降落，然后升得更高
[02:25.80]尽其可能

[02:28.98]每个人都会找到属于自己的花束
[02:37.60]即使死亡也会夺走他们的气息
[02:50.20]故事在此鲜活地延续
[03:04.30]

